      en: ["Sorghum is one of the top three staple crops in Kirundo, alongside maize and cassava.", "Kirundo province is home to eight significant lakes, including Lake Rweru and Lake Cohoha.", "Traditional sorghum beer, ikigage, is a staple at Burundian social and ritual gatherings.", "The region is often referred to as northern Burundi's primary agricultural breadbasket.", "Sorghum's low water requirement makes it perfectly suited for the semi-arid local climate.", "The main sorghum harvest in Kirundo typically occurs during June and July."],
