      en: ["Lake Tanganyika is the world's second-deepest lake, reaching depths of 1,470 meters.", "Saga Beach is one of the most popular and well-developed stretches of the shoreline.", "The Mukeke fish is a local specialty found only in the waters of Lake Tanganyika.", "The beach area is situated at an elevation of approximately 773 meters.", "Hippos are occasionally spotted in the shallower waters near the shore in the morning.", "The lake water maintains a consistent temperature between 24 and 27 degrees Celsius."],
      es: ["Longitud: 500 metros.", "Temperatura del agua: 25-26°C.", "Entrada gratuita.", "Visitantes de fin de semana: hasta 3.000.", "Campaña de limpieza 2019: se eliminaron 2 toneladas de basura.", "Número de palmeras: aprox. 80."],
      pt: ["Extensão: 500 metros.", "Temperatura da água: 25-26°C.", "Entrada gratuita.", "Visitantes ao fim de semana: até 3.000.", "Ação de limpeza 2019: 2 toneladas de lixo removidas.", "Número de palmeiras: aprox. 80."],
